{"id":"iamkira","lines":[{"t":7.78,"end":12.197,"chars":[0],"who":"Naomi","text":"Uh so, if you don't mind me asking, why do you keep checking your watch?","de":"Äh, wenn ich fragen darf — warum schaust du ständig auf deine Uhr?","orig":"scenes/iamkira/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":12.475,"end":14.475,"chars":[1],"who":"Light","text":"Oh, well.","de":"Oh, nun ja.","orig":"scenes/iamkira/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":15.073,"end":17.49,"chars":[1],"who":"Light","text":"I guess it's because...","de":"Ich schätz, weil...","orig":"scenes/iamkira/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":19.537,"end":21.971,"chars":[1],"who":"Light","text":"Because I'm Kira.","de":"Weil ich Kira bin.","orig":"scenes/iamkira/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":22.45,"end":23.65,"chars":[0],"who":"Naomi","text":"(Quiet Gasp)","de":"*leises Keuchen*","orig":"scenes/iamkira/lines/05.mp3"}]}